  "message": "Using the 2017 Form 10-K disclosures: cash and equivalents at December 31, 2017 was $7.0 billion (source p1n2 = 7.0, in billions), and cash held on behalf of GE was $997 million (source p2n0). Since $7.0 billion equals 7,000 million, the percentage is (997 / 7,000) × 100 = 14.24%.",
